{
  "about": [
    "Kimi Code quota from end to end, one set of cases both ends are proved against. Each case is what",
    "Kimi Code's `GET <base_url>/usages` answered for each of a runner's Kimi accounts (`usages`, by",
    "account id, exactly as Kimi sends it), the heartbeat planUsage the runner sends for those readings",
    "(`planUsage`, fetchedAt left out), and what the control plane decides from it: the account a new",
    "session starts on (`startOn`, accountToStartOn) and, per account, until when its quota holds a run",
    "back (`blockedUntil`, planUsageBlockedUntil; null: it does not). src/runner-go",
    "kimi_usage_test.go reads `usages` and must send `planUsage`; planUsage.spec.ts reads `planUsage`",
    "and must decide `startOn` and `blockedUntil`."
  ],
